state:TransactionView.status.body:
`empty` with no transaction to show; `loading` while it is read; `ready` once it is on screen;
`notFound` when no such transaction exists; `notFoundInWindow` when one opened without
`createdAt` was not found in the last ~12 months; `failed` when the read failed.

